<section class="sec" id="services">
  <div class="sec-head rv"><span class="sec-idx">01</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">Every part of the roof, covered.</h2><p class="lead">Repairs and restorations by someone who has tiled roofs his whole career. Right materials, right method, no shortcuts.</p></div></div>
  <div class="svc-grid">
    <article class="svc rv"><span class="n">01</span><h3>Roof repairs</h3><p>Broken tiles, leaks, flashing and storm damage fixed properly at the source.</p></article>
    <article class="svc rv"><span class="n">02</span><h3>Roof restoration</h3><p>Full restoration: repair, pressure clean, re-point, seal and paint for a roof that looks after itself.</p></article>
    <article class="svc rv"><span class="n">03</span><h3>Gutters &amp; fascia</h3><p>Gutter replacement, fascia covers and downpipe work that moves water away from the house.</p></article>
    <article class="svc rv"><span class="n">04</span><h3>Leak detection</h3><p>We find the actual source of the leak, not just the stain on the ceiling.</p></article>
    <article class="svc rv"><span class="n">05</span><h3>Re-tiling &amp; ridge capping</h3><p>New tile work, and re-bedding and re-pointing of ridge caps done to hold.</p></article>
    <article class="svc rv"><span class="n">06</span><h3>Licensed &amp; insured</h3><p>Lic 465538C. Trade-qualified work that stands behind the name.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec--tint" id="process">
  <div class="sec-head rv"><span class="sec-idx">02</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">Straight answers, straight pricing.</h2></div></div>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step rv"><b>01</b><h3>Get in touch</h3><p>Call with the problem: a leak, storm damage or a tired-looking roof.</p></div>
    <div class="step rv"><b>02</b><h3>Inspection &amp; quote</h3><p>We get up there, find the issue and price the fix in writing.</p></div>
    <div class="step rv"><b>03</b><h3>The work</h3><p>Done right: right materials, right method, no shortcuts.</p></div>
    <div class="step rv"><b>04</b><h3>Final check</h3><p>We make sure it is watertight and the site is left clean.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="faq">
  <div class="sec-head rv"><span class="sec-idx">03</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">Asked on every roof.</h2></div></div>
  <div class="faq">
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>Are you licensed?</summary><div class="a">Yes. A licensed roof tiler, Lic 465538C, and fully insured.</div></details>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>Do you do storm emergencies?</summary><div class="a">Yes. Open 24 hours for leaks and storm damage on the Central Coast.</div></details>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>Repair or full restoration?</summary><div class="a">Both. We repair what is worth repairing and restore roofs that have life left in them.</div></details>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>Which areas do you cover?</summary><div class="a">The Central Coast, Newcastle and surrounding areas of NSW.</div></details>
  </div>
</section>

